Value BGP_ROUTER_ID (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value LOCAL_AS (\d+)
Value NEIGHBOR (\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)
Value REMOTE_AS (\d+)
Value STATE_PFXRCD (\S+)

Start
  ^BGP router identifier ${BGP_ROUTER_ID}, local AS number ${LOCAL_AS}
  ^${NEIGHBOR}\s+4\s+${REMOTE_AS}\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+\d+\s+${STATE_PFXRCD} -> Record
